# ADE Infra Core

- Single source of truth per fact (ports, bind address, token env vars). Default API: `127.0.0.1:3210`.
- Scripts are idempotent; safe to run twice on healthy state.
- Anything that must stay up: health endpoint (`/health/live`), restart path, and a one-line status check.
- Full absolute interpreter/binary paths on Windows; verify the process actually starts after wiring.
- Secrets in env / vault only — never in rules, skills, AGENTS.md, or committed configs.
- Before removing a service or port, grep the tree for references.
